{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53293","headline":"诗偈 四 · 庞藴","name":"诗偈 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一年复一年，务在且迁延。\n皮皱缘肉减，发白髓枯乾。\n毛孔通风过，骨消椽梠宽。\n水微不耐热，火少不耐寒。\n幻身如聚沫，四大亦非坚。\n更被痴狼使，无明晓夜煎。\n惟知念水草，心神被物缠。\n云何不忏悔，便道舍财钱。\n外头遮曲语，望得免前愆。\n地狱应无事，准拟得生天。\n世间有这属，冥道不如然。\n除非不作业，当拔罪根源。\n根空尘不实，内外绝因缘。\n积罪如山岳，慧火一时燃。\n须臾变灰烬，永劫更无烟。\n。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"庞藴","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53293.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53293","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}